    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sessionSubjectStage is functional: an agent session acts on behalf of exactly one subject stage, the single session → subject hop that lets an output resolve to its durable subject. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:sessionSubjectStage ;
