    gmeow:howToUse "Validate each observation and its own result against its own metric dimension; retain the canonical Quantity profile."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Each guard follows one observation to its own metric and result; neighboring observations cannot supply missing dimensions or values."@x-gmeow-english ;
